[b][color=#55ccff]C[/color][/b] — Jongkok (Crouch)
[b][color=#55ccff]Q / E[/color][/b] — Miring Kiri / Kanan (Lean)
[b][color=#55ccff]Klik Kiri / Klik Kanan[/color][/b] — Tembak / Bidik (Aim)
[b][color=#55ccff]R / F / G[/color][/b] — Reload / Melee / Drop Senjata
